There are many people in the bus.
I find an empty seat.
I sit on the seat.
The bus conductor comes to me.
There are tickets in his hand.
I say, "Bhaiya, I need to get to the main metro station."
"Please give one ticket for there."
The conductor looks at me.
He says, "Fifteen rupees."
I take out money from my bag.
I give him fifteen rupees.
He gives me a small paper ticket.
I look at the ticket.
I keep it in my pocket.
The bus moves forward quickly.
I look outside from the window.
I need to alight at the main metro station.
